TEST_START: playlist & party presets / a single-category pool does not deadlock — it just repeats
TEST_START: playlist & party presets / a game with several arenas avoids repeating the immediately previous one
TEST_START: playlist & party presets / preset ids come from data, not code
TEST_START: playlist & party presets / from_preset() honours each preset's own shape
TEST_START: playlist & party presets / a category-filtered preset only draws from its categories
